          {
            "Text": "Represents job functions specific to this job (for example Accounting, Marketing, Sales). Category names are predefined by LinkedIn and can be retrieved from Job Functions reference table.If predefined LinkedIn values are provided, they are displayed on the LinkedIn Job Posting If none of the values match our predefined LinkedIn values, we recommend partner to still provide raw values. This allows customers to configure job field processors directly with LinkedIn support If no value is provided, then LinkedIn will infer a value by referencing other fields of the Job Posting",
